                            <div class="text-4xl text-white/30 font-extrabold">01</div>
                            <div class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-white/30"></div>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-3 leading-tight tracking-tight">
                            Branding</h3>
                        <p class="text-base md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 max-w-2xl">Visual
                            identity and design systems that hold together across every touchpoint, from a pitch deck to
